}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
An invariant subspace means that acting first and then embedding gives the \
same result as embedding first and then acting. The following three zero \
matrices establish that statement for the entire triplet, not just one state.\
\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d9de3edc-a7b6-4cad-8837-d40334d12699"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

