Cell["\<\
At a 90 degree angle, the x direction rotates to the y direction. The sign \
convention is an active rotation acting on column vectors.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.003308618291803*^9, 
  4.0033086190800753`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"133145e5-f031-4a0d-8db1-\
44ff2a8255bb"],

